# PowerHaus Academy Branding Assets

This folder contains the logo and branding assets for PowerHaus Academy.

## Files to upload:

- `powerhaus-logo.png` - Main logo (recommended: 500x200px, transparent PNG)
- `powerhaus-logo-white.png` - White version for dark backgrounds
- `favicon.ico` - Browser favicon (32x32px)
- `favicon.png` - PNG favicon (32x32px)

Upload your logo files here and they will be automatically used throughout the app.
